<title>RUSSIA: Russian inflation quickens to 0.4 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Russian inflation quickens to 0.4 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian inflation accelerated in the week ended December 9 to 0.4 percent from 0.3 percent in the previous week, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The periods were not strictly comparable, as the latest week ran from November 30 to December 9 and the previous week ran only from November 26 to 29.</p>
<p>Prices have risen 20.5 percent so far this year, it said.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    w/e Dec 9	    w/e Nov 29</p>
<p>    Week-on-week change		+0.4		    +0.3</p>
<p>					   Dec 1-9		Nov 1-30</p>
<p>    Average daily inflation	  +0.036		  +0.061</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
